{"title":"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the six-digit number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/7/8373efd3afccc186a656c5f77a1948bc5e74ad5c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1ABCDE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"84\" height=\"14\" />, each letter represents a digit. Given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/d/03d6af0b2610da60853db50833c2b5bcf7c7a396.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1ABCDE \\times 3 = ABCDE1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"221\" height=\"16\" />, the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/b/79beafef51578909489be5664f582ce5b4e83385.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A + B + C + D + E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"161\" height=\"14\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/1/83107fe071447b45cc8e6717984f047bda33a53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 29 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 26 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 22 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 30 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"397\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the units digit is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> in the first number but the, the only possible value for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. The product is then:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/6/e966b1448108cabb98fa00b266916d7844aa7a58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1ABCD7 \\times 3 = ABCD71$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"210\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/0/e5061878e47614e71d424253cc7d146ab3f0e64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7 \\times 3 = 21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/e/36e2b314e6c43ad7528743da77ea85bab5cc424f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D \\times 3 + 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"80\" height=\"16\" /> must have a units digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. This means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/7/d77ec1dfbf1ebf40cd2d576d14e8c50774b752e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3D$\" width=\"24\" height=\"12\" /> has a units digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, which can only occur if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/9/0591b54746d40d0a11da8371abcdd49096e31b4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/b/0bb635114ad6472962160e4e230cf0500fe16313.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1ABC57 \\times 3 = ABC571$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"197\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/6/8c6beabfa5c225f03232de0470bd82e7c09dc78a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 \\times 3 + 2 = 17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"116\" height=\"15\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/2/9f24c0da25318daa13afd8a10aa7f953df255801.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3C + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"57\" height=\"16\" /> has a units digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, meaning <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/3/c532ffabd8059b3f068983ef1c257952e8207367.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" /> has a units digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. The only possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/f/6bfbefbf0182296f41ca15f7aad8f6f8ae2ea682.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1AB857 \\times 3 = AB8571$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"187\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/4/c84a4c4361739193cef1af446c720f1281b855ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\times 8 + 1 = 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"116\" height=\"15\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/5/82504b4981d23e059b3b723f41e2e4a56516d44c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3B + 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"57\" height=\"16\" /> has a units digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, meaning <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/9/cb93b9dbd8a783496111be0f383d889cf5aebfb4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3B$\" width=\"23\" height=\"12\" /> has a units digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. The only way for this to happen is if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/4/ed45766ae06d282b582b4b49d4289dcc81331314.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B = 2$\" width=\"47\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/b/d5b7cbf0c1514043ff281ac899ad1fc877a2fefb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1A2857 = A28571$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"144\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/a/1caa6027518a9b3756d8cecd98c702c8592d6150.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times 3 + 2 = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"107\" height=\"15\" />, so there is no carrying this time. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/7/277808a033b0d645b6df93e4ec60050444c8ad88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" /> must have a units digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/b/79beafef51578909489be5664f582ce5b4e83385.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A + B + C + D + E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"161\" height=\"14\" /> is then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/7/1477f26ea8a2c8ac73d9bd4b41afa7269fd0fa12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 + 2 + 8 + 5 + 7 = 6 + 13 + 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"241\" height=\"15\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/6/37648883f81939842f648c8e7f04dfb9f0bdbcaa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 + 20 = \\boxed{\\textbf {(B) } 26}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"140\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 19 (page does not exist)\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 21 (page does not exist)\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 15 (page does not exist)\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 19 (page does not exist)\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 21 (page does not exist)\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 24 (page does not exist)\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 25 (page does not exist)\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017221106\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.029 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.044 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 208/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2333/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 593/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6842/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.407      1 Template:CEMC_box\n100.00%    7.407      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37663:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017221106 and revision id 291492. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}